  "prefLabel": "Inst 702.07 Footing",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Inst 702.07 “Footing” means part of the support system that sits directly on the ground or slab, it is between the ground or slab, and the pier not including shims or caps.\n\nSource. #14221, eff 2-25-25",
